WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.400
A barter movement does not need a crowd.
It starts with two people.

00:04.400 --> 00:08.000
Post one real good or skill.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.200
Invite one person who might genuinely want it.

00:12.200 --> 00:15.400
Agree clearly, and trade safely.

00:15.400 --> 00:21.440
Unscrewed is open across the United States, with no listing fees,
no transaction fees, and no fake activity.
Start your two-person barter circle at unscrewed dot L O L.
